Z||000004||LZeitgeist||06-18-2001||05:19 PM||||Songman - <P>I appreciate the offer, but Dad's/mine have already been taken care of...<P>I just happened to use this thread to try and point out a side of the situation that Bam-Bam might not have thought about, since he seems to post live auctions pretty regularily... <P><BR>Bam-Bam - <P>No offense intended, my friend... I would just hate to see somebody come down hard on you for doing what you feel is a good and helpful thing and accidentally causing them 100x more competition for the item than they would have had if no one else had been thinking about/looking for the item... you know what they say, 'The road to Hell is paved with good intentions..."||||reg||1
